    "body": "fix on issue/3173-gate-unit-sweep · PR #3552 · pinned by `unit_sweep_tests::a_link_at_the_package_level_is_skipped` and `unit_sweep_tests::a_path_that_differs_only_by_case_is_one_form_on_a_case_insensitive_volume` · merges when reviewed\n\nNote: `cargo xtask gate quick` cannot go green on this Windows checkout. Three\nsteps fail without this diff: the two catalog tests (stale generated content\nunder `site/content/` and `examples/catalog/`), and the light-lane law test\n(it greps `AGENTS.md` for LF text; this checkout has CRLF from\n`core.autocrlf=true`). The touched suite `unit_sweep_tests` is green (14\npassed) and `cargo clippy -p xtask --all-targets -- -D warnings` is clean.\nDetails are in the PR body.\n",
